  "chapter": "第3话",
  "language_mode": "中文",
  "text_metadata_version": 1,
  "items": [
    {
      "item_id": "L001",
      "panel_id": "P001",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "月色凄冷。",
      "lang": "zh-Hans",
      "dir": "ltr",
      "script": "Hans",
      "line_break": "cjk",
      "text_source": "月色凄冷。姜月初拖着裴长青的尸体，找到一块还算平整的土坡，用横刀挖着。",
      "source_lang": "und",
      "source_dir": "ltr",
      "text_zh": "月色凄冷。",
      "slot_id": "B001N",
      "style": {
        "font": "project_default",
        "size": 42,
        "direction": "horizontal",
        "bubble": "caption"
      }
    },
    {
      "item_id": "L002",
      "panel_id": "P002",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "能入土为安，已经算对得起他了。",
      "lang": "zh-Hans",
      "dir": "ltr",
      "script": "Hans",
      "line_break": "cjk",
      "text_source": "挖了半天，也只是个浅坑。罢了。这荒郊野岭的，能入土为安，已经算对得起他了。",
      "source_lang": "und",
      "source_dir": "ltr",
      "text_zh": "能入土为安，已经算对得起他了。",
      "slot_id": "B002N",
      "style": {
        "font": "project_default",
        "size": 42,
        "direction": "horizontal",
        "bubble": "caption"
      }
    },
    {
      "item_id": "L003",
      "panel_id": "P003",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "人死了，身上的东西还是有用的。",
      "lang": "zh-Hans",
      "dir": "ltr",
      "script": "Hans",
      "line_break": "cjk",
      "text_source": "做完这一切，她才回身，走向那些镇魔卫的尸体。人死鸟朝天，不死万万年。可人死了，身上的东西还是有用的。",
      "source_lang": "und",
      "source_dir": "ltr",
      "text_zh": "人死了，身上的东西还是有用的。",
      "slot_id": "B003N",
      "style": {
        "font": "project_default",
        "size": 42,
        "direction": "horizontal",
        "bubble": "caption"
      }
    },
    {
      "item_id": "L004",
      "panel_id": "P004",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "囚服走到哪，都是活靶子。",
      "lang": "zh-Hans",
      "dir": "ltr",
      "script": "Hans",
      "line_break": "cjk",
      "text_source": "最后，她的目光落在一具身材与自己相仿的尸身上。那人很年轻，脸上还带着几分稚气。姜月初沉默片刻。“......得罪了，兄弟。”",
      "source_lang": "und",
      "source_dir": "ltr",
      "text_zh": "囚服走到哪，都是活靶子。",
      "slot_id": "B004N",
      "style": {
        "font": "project_default",
        "size": 42,
        "direction": "horizontal",
        "bubble": "caption"
      }
    },
    {
      "item_id": "L005",
      "panel_id": "P004",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "姜月初",
      "text": "……得罪了，兄弟。",
      "lang": "zh-Hans",
      "dir": "ltr",
      "script": "Hans",
      "line_break": "cjk",
      "text_zh": "……得罪了，兄弟。",
      "tone": "低声",
      "slot_id": "B004D1",
      "style": {
        "font": "project_default",
        "size": 44,
        "direction": "horizontal",
        "bubble": "round"
      }
    },
    {
      "item_id": "L006",
      "panel_id": "P005",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "两害相权，她宁可选那个看起来更不好惹的身份。",
      "lang": "zh-Hans",
      "dir": "ltr",
      "script": "Hans",
      "line_break": "cjk",
      "text_source": "衣物上满是血污和破口，穿在身上又冷又硬。她将长发束起，按着记忆里的样子，胡乱扎了个马尾，又将横刀挂在腰间。",
      "source_lang": "und",
      "source_dir": "ltr",
      "text_zh": "两害相权，她宁可选那个看起来更不好惹的身份。",
      "slot_id": "B005N",
      "style": {
        "font": "project_default",
        "size": 42,
        "direction": "horizontal",
        "bubble": "caption"
      }
    },
    {
      "item_id": "L007",
      "panel_id": "P006",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "官道上空无一人，只有孤月相伴。",
      "lang": "zh-Hans",
      "dir": "ltr",
      "script": "Hans",
      "line_break": "cjk",
      "text_source": "她不再停留，辨明了方向，踏上了官道。官道上空无一人，只有孤月相伴。",
      "source_lang": "und",
      "source_dir": "ltr",
      "text_zh": "官道上空无一人，只有孤月相伴。",
      "slot_id": "B006N",
      "style": {
        "font": "project_default",
        "size": 42,
        "direction": "horizontal",
        "bubble": "caption"
      }
    },
    {
      "item_id": "L008",
      "panel_id": "P007",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "无籍者，是黑户。无引者，是流民。",
      "lang": "zh-Hans",
      "dir": "ltr",
      "script": "Hans",
      "line_break": "cjk",
      "text_source": "眼下的当务之急，便是解决户籍路引的问题。无籍者，是为黑户。无引者，是为流民。两者一旦被官府查获，下场都好不到哪里去。",
      "source_lang": "und",
      "source_dir": "ltr",
      "text_zh": "无籍者，是黑户。无引者，是流民。",
      "slot_id": "B007N",
      "style": {
        "font": "project_default",
        "size": 42,
        "direction": "horizontal",
        "bubble": "caption"
      }
    },
    {
      "item_id": "L009",
      "panel_id": "P008",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "姜月初",
      "text": "走一步看一步吧。",
      "lang": "zh-Hans",
      "dir": "ltr",
      "script": "Hans",
      "line_break": "cjk",
      "text_zh": "走一步看一步吧。",
      "tone": "低声认命",
      "slot_id": "B008D1",
      "style": {
        "font": "project_default",
        "size": 44,
        "direction": "horizontal",
        "bubble": "round"
      }
    },
    {
      "item_id": "L010",
      "panel_id": "P009",
      "type": "sfx",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "嘚嘚嘚——",
      "lang": "zh-Hans",
      "dir": "ltr",
      "script": "Hans",
      "line_break": "cjk",
      "text_zh": "嘚嘚嘚——",
      "slot_id": "B009S",
      "style": {
        "font": "project_default",
        "size": 72,
        "direction": "horizontal",
        "bubble": "none",
        "drawn_lettering_mode": "drawn_sfx",
        "integration": "integrate with action path or impact zone; do not cover face, hands, key props, or final dialogue slots",
        "shape": "match sound quality: jagged for impact, stretched for speed, soft for ambience"
      }
    },
    {
      "item_id": "L011",
      "panel_id": "P010",
      "type": "sfx",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "吁——",
      "lang": "zh-Hans",
      "dir": "ltr",
      "script": "Hans",
      "line_break": "cjk",
      "text_zh": "吁——",
      "slot_id": "B010S",
      "style": {
        "font": "project_default",
        "size": 72,
        "direction": "horizontal",
        "bubble": "none",
        "drawn_lettering_mode": "drawn_sfx",
        "integration": "integrate with action path or impact zone; do not cover face, hands, key props, or final dialogue slots",
        "shape": "match sound quality: jagged for impact, stretched for speed, soft for ambience"
      }
    },
    {
      "item_id": "L012",
      "panel_id": "P011",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "姜月初心中咯噔一下。",
      "lang": "zh-Hans",
      "dir": "ltr",
      "script": "Hans",
      "line_break": "cjk",
      "text_source": "那汉子翻身下马，快步上前几步，抱拳躬身。“敢问......可是镇魔司的大人当面？”",
      "source_lang": "und",
      "source_dir": "ltr",
      "text_zh": "姜月初心中咯噔一下。",
      "slot_id": "B011N",
      "style": {
        "font": "project_default",
        "size": 42,
        "direction": "horizontal",
        "bubble": "caption"
      }
    },
    {
      "item_id": "L013",
      "panel_id": "P011",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "陈青源",
      "text": "敢问……可是镇魔司的大人当面？",
      "lang": "zh-Hans",
      "dir": "ltr",
      "script": "Hans",
      "line_break": "cjk",
      "text_zh": "敢问……可是镇魔司的大人当面？",
      "tone": "恭敬急切",
      "slot_id": "B011D1",
      "style": {
        "font": "project_default",
        "size": 44,
        "direction": "horizontal",
        "bubble": "round"
      }
    },
    {
      "item_id": "L014",
      "panel_id": "P012",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "装！必须装下去！",
      "lang": "zh-Hans",
      "dir": "ltr",
      "script": "Hans",
      "line_break": "cjk",
      "text_source": "装！必须装下去！言多必失，最高冷的逼格就是不说话！她没有回答，只是冷冷地看着那汉子。",
      "source_lang": "und",
      "source_dir": "ltr",
      "text_zh": "装！必须装下去！",
      "slot_id": "B012N",
      "style": {
        "font": "project_default",
        "size": 42,
        "direction": "horizontal",
        "bubble": "caption"
      }
    },
    {
      "item_id": "L015",
      "panel_id": "P012",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "姜月初",
      "text": "何事？",
      "lang": "zh-Hans",
      "dir": "ltr",
      "script": "Hans",
      "line_break": "cjk",
      "text_zh": "何事？",
      "tone": "刻意压低",
      "slot_id": "B012D1",
      "style": {
        "font": "project_default",
        "size": 44,
        "direction": "horizontal",
        "bubble": "round"
      }
    },
    {
      "item_id": "L016",
      "panel_id": "P013",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "陈青源",
      "text": "在下陈青源，广武县飞鹰门门主。",
      "lang": "zh-Hans",
      "dir": "ltr",
      "script": "Hans",
      "line_break": "cjk",
      "text_zh": "在下陈青源，广武县飞鹰门门主。",
      "tone": "急切自报",
      "slot_id": "B013D1",
      "style": {
        "font": "project_default",
        "size": 44,
        "direction": "horizontal",
        "bubble": "round"
      }
    },
    {
      "item_id": "L017",
      "panel_id": "P013",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "陈青源",
      "text": "我等奉县令手令，星夜驰援上盘村。",
      "lang": "zh-Hans",
      "dir": "ltr",
      "script": "Hans",
      "line_break": "cjk",
      "text_zh": "我等奉县令手令，星夜驰援上盘村。",
      "tone": "求援",
      "slot_id": "B013D2",
      "style": {
        "font": "project_default",
        "size": 44,
        "direction": "horizontal",
        "bubble": "round"
      }
    },
    {
      "item_id": "L018",
      "panel_id": "P014",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "活下来的人，被像猪羊一样圈在祠堂里。",
      "lang": "zh-Hans",
      "dir": "ltr",
      "script": "Hans",
      "line_break": "cjk",
      "text_source": "三日前，有一伙狼妖闯入村中，屠戮百姓，占据了村子！它们将活下来的人像猪羊一样圈养在祠堂里。",
      "source_lang": "und",
      "source_dir": "ltr",
      "text_zh": "活下来的人，被像猪羊一样圈在祠堂里。",
      "slot_id": "B014N",
      "style": {
        "font": "project_default",
        "size": 42,
        "direction": "horizontal",
        "bubble": "caption"
      }
    },
    {
      "item_id": "L019",
      "panel_id": "P014",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "陈青源",
      "text": "一伙狼妖闯入上盘村，屠戮百姓，占了村子！",
      "lang": "zh-Hans",
      "dir": "ltr",
      "script": "Hans",
      "line_break": "cjk",
      "text_zh": "一伙狼妖闯入上盘村，屠戮百姓，占了村子！",
      "tone": "压抑愤怒",
      "slot_id": "B014D1",
      "style": {
        "font": "project_default",
        "size": 44,
        "direction": "horizontal",
        "bubble": "round"
      }
    },
    {
      "item_id": "L020",
      "panel_id": "P015",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "陈青源",
      "text": "恳请大人出手，救百姓于水火！",
      "lang": "zh-Hans",
      "dir": "ltr",
      "script": "Hans",
      "line_break": "cjk",
      "text_zh": "恳请大人出手，救百姓于水火！",
      "tone": "恳切",
      "slot_id": "B015D1",
      "style": {
        "font": "project_default",
        "size": 44,
        "direction": "horizontal",
        "bubble": "round"
      }
    },
    {
      "item_id": "L021",
      "panel_id": "P015",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "飞鹰门众人",
      "text": "恳请大人出手！",
      "lang": "zh-Hans",
      "dir": "ltr",
      "script": "Hans",
      "line_break": "cjk",
      "text_zh": "恳请大人出手！",
      "tone": "齐声",
      "slot_id": "B015D2",
      "style": {
        "font": "project_default",
        "size": 44,
        "direction": "horizontal",
        "bubble": "round"
      }
    },
    {
      "item_id": "L022",
      "panel_id": "P016",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "那我还活鸡毛了。跳了兄弟。",
      "lang": "zh-Hans",
      "dir": "ltr",
      "script": "Hans",
      "line_break": "cjk",
      "text_source": "姜月初：“......”她彻底麻了。好好好......老天爷，你要这样玩我是吧？那我还活鸡毛了。跳了兄弟。",
      "source_lang": "und",
      "source_dir": "ltr",
      "text_zh": "那我还活鸡毛了。跳了兄弟。",
      "slot_id": "B016N",
      "style": {
        "font": "project_default",
        "size": 42,
        "direction": "horizontal",
        "bubble": "caption"
      }
    }
  ]
}
